@startuml
title CANCEL DIALOG - コマンド相互作用図
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
' Source: ScenarioRunner.Engine/Execution/ScenarioCommandExecutor.cs
' Source: ScenarioRunner.Engine/Automation/Operator/Feature/DialogOperator.cs
participant "ScenarioCommandExecutor" as EX
participant "DialogOperator" as O
participant "ProcessWindowWaiter" as PW
participant "ButtonOperator" as BO
participant "WindowWaiter" as WW
participant "GuiSession" as S

EX -> O : Cancel(session)
activate O
O -> O : executeDecision(session, false)
O -> O : getDecisionDialog(session)
alt キャッシュが有効・表示中・操作可能
O -> S : LastCheckedDialog を参照
else キャッシュなし／無効
O -> PW : WaitForProcessWindow(session, owner if known, predicate)
note right of PW
  表示中かつ有効な標準MessageBox、
  または既知のダイアログIDを検出
end note
PW --> O : dialog
end
O -> O : getDecisionButtonId(dialog, false)
alt 対応する操作が定義されている
O -> BO : PostClick(dialog, automationId)
O -> WW : WaitForWindowClosed(handle)
else 操作を特定できない
O -> O : InvalidOperationException
end
O -> S : LastCheckedDialog / Buttons を破棄（finally）
O --> EX : 処理完了（失敗時は例外）
deactivate O
@enduml
